obs The parked ratchet_slack_pairs text version matches ancestor history. Its removed dated-path row is accounted for by b84ae748b, which renamed the ungated history reading. Keep today's list. After the hook and lock dispositions, 204 unmatched record versions remain for semantic review: 176 Markdown, 27 other Kyri, and one Cursor rule. The inventory names each source stash and tree.
